Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:12.49,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.98,0:01:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is a physical body?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The body is merely an object.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is an existence all too impure to{\i0}\N{\i1}store the gods within us called souls.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.38,0:02:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, you will remember.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.53,0:02:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bloodstained history!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Material desire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hunger.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sexual drive.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Desire to dominate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.81,0:02:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Desire for fame.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As long as there is a body,{\i0}\N{\i1}desires will be born.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As long as there is desire,{\i0}\N{\i1}human ego will not disappear.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.21,0:02:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Humans will continue to fight to fulfill their bodies' desires, and it will never end.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At this rate, there is no future!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, awaken your soul!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, be rid of that filthy body!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We are SCRATCH,{\i0}\N{\i1}an electronic transcendence group.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.07,0:02:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We are disciples of God, sent here\Nto free your soul from your body{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and lead you to the infinite sea of electrons.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good evening. This is CBC News.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.72,0:03:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First, we have news about the{\i0}\N{\i1}electronic transcendence group SCRATCH.{\i0} {linked to lower CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Last week, the ISSP and all{\i0}\N{\i1}Sol solar system police departments{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}received the wanted poster{\i0}\N{\i1}for the leader, Londes,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and began searching the homes{\i0}\N{\i1}of high-ranking members—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here at the scene...{\i0} {lead-out decreased by 1 frame}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enticing people with "easy entry"{\i0}\N{\i1}and "salvation of the soul",{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}SCRATCH has been able to{\i0}\N{\i1}constantly grow in numbers.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, another suicide—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The members of SCRATCH use{\i0}\N{\i1}the brain wave control device{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}on this new game console to{\i0}\N{\i1}scan their own brain waves{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and use a program created{\i0}\N{\i1}by their leader, Londes,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which is said to copy the spirit{\i0}\N{\i1}from brain waves as digital data{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.03,0:04:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and upload that spirit data{\i0}\N{\i1}into the universal network.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.37,0:04:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They believe that doing this will make{\i0}\N{\i1}them exist as a soul without a body.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now Professor, they say that Londes,{\i0}\N{\i1}the leader, was once a doctor.{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is such a thing possible?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is ridiculous.\NCompletely in the realm of sci-fi.{\i0} {letting bleed to lower CPS}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It may be theoretically possible to do so,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but a theory is only a theory, in the end.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.91,0:04:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, and{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he hasn't returned for two weeks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady, you have to talk it out\Nwith your husband.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's about your son...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But... He isn't the type that{\i0}\N{\i1}would just run away from home...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could he have been kidnapped?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady, are you listening to what I'm saying?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's got to be it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That religion that's been popular{\i0}\N{\i1}lately... That whatchamacallit—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:45.26,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right, we're gonna take a break.{\i0} {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hi! Today, I'm introducing Power CDJ,\Nan item for DJ's who don't exercise much!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You adjust the BPM using this lever,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:05:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and it allows you to{\i0}\N{\i1}be a DJ while you exercise!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then, the reason you decided to join is...?{\i0} {9 frames?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.81,0:05:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, er, I... I got tired of a debt-filled life,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and that was when I found this... Yes...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I rid myself of a body,{\i0}\N{\i1}I'll no longer need money!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, it's almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care! Just get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}By releasing the spirit from the body,{\i0}\N{\i1}we are able to discard all desire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So you're going to forget your debt?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we hadn't seen her in\Na while. What kind of joke is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Brain Dream!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The new game console,\NBrain Dream, can read your mind!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Control {\i0}your{\i1} games{\i0}\N{\i1}the way that {\i0}you {\i1}want to!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you always fighting with your controls?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do the cords get tangled?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that's the case then let's dream together!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so, at our station, we have\Nthe strictest policies in the world,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and against programs such as this—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat now! {lead-out decreased by 2 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Londes. Wanted for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The bounty is an amazing 38 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. That's enough for\Nher to flake out on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy was apparently\Na neurobiology researcher fifty years ago. {extra lead-in. Lead-out decreased by 1 frame}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.77,0:06:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,However, one day he suddenly\Nhad a vision from God
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and immersed himself in research\Nto store the human spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the functions of the brain\Nitself, as digital data.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then, he's been missing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, two years ago, he suddenly\Nreappeared to form
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the electronic transcendence\Ngroup SCRATCH. {left the 2.0 timing split}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, a new religious cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, according to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.65,0:06:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The human brain function itself is\Na weak stream of electronic pulses,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you are able to copy that\Nas data, and replay it over
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the universal network as a program,\Nyou can exist only as a soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's up to you to believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There are already 20,000 believers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of which approximately 100 have\Ncommitted suicide or ended up missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And so the cops have started\Nmoving their lazy asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His face ain't appetizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go after him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We are SCRATCH,{\i0}\N{\i1}an electronic transcendence group.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We are disciples of God, sent here\Nto free your soul from your body{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.67,0:07:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and lead you to the infinite sea of electrons.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.63,0:08:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching, searching, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:09:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you want to be a member as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For that, we need to cleanse your soul first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As the first step—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... before that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to meet this Mr. Londes...\NDo you know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Londes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum, did such a guy exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya gotta help me, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only colleague of\Nhis that is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you remember something? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he existed... Maybe he didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then you want to be a member as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:09:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For that, we need to cleanse your soul first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.23,0:10:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As the first step—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, can I ask something before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Mr. Londes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anything, his soul or whatever,\Nwill do, but how can I meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to become a member?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so Dr. Londes is the{\i0}\N{\i1}center of everyone's attention...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The first big-name guy in a while!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unfortunately, we have{\i0}\N{\i1}absolutely no new information!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, my...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone is doing their best to find him,{\i0}\N{\i1}but there just isn't any information.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're seeing his face virtually every day\Nfrom SCRATCH's TV programs, {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.82,0:10:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but we know nothing important about him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he really a soul without a body?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, I have one other{\i0}\N{\i1}bit of important news for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh? What is it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Actually...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry up and tell me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:11:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've been on the air{\i0}\N{\i1}for a long time now,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I know it's sudden,{\i0}\N{\i1}but this is our final episode!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're kidding!{\i0} {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're canning us because of{\i0}\N{\i1}low ratings, unfortunately...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.28,0:11:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Boo hoo hoo...{\i0} {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Boo hoo hoo"?! How come\NI didn't hear about this?!{\i0} {original: "Unfortunately?! How come I didn't hear about this?!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No good?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I got nothing, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, nope...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I went after his colleagues\Nfrom his research days,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And I got nothing out of the members.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Faye-Faye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.17,0:11:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm in... a little trouble.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.38,0:11:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you listening...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think I really can... get rid of my debt...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.25,0:12:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm trusting you with Faye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I'm gonna be having a hard time if{\i0}\N{\i1}you're gonna be baby-sitting forever...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Brain Dream is pretty rare!\NI have to line up here if I want one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you really going{\i0}\N{\i1}to hack into his home page?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only lead we got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Beyond that... Faye seems to have{\i0}\N{\i1}dug something up, so we can use that—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof, it's about that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Welcome to SCRATCH,{\i0}\N{\i1}an electronic transcendence group.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.75,0:12:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Head straight if you wish to join us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Head over that way to request more{\i0}\N{\i1}detailed information about SCRATCH.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess I can't copy\Nmy spirit immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I have no choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:13:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Joining us? Please input your personal data.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Data, data.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fake data! {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Blood, muscle, and bone...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When those are lost, humans face death...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.11,0:13:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What lies beyond that?{\i0}\N{\i1}Heaven? Hell? Reincarnation?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.19,0:13:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Such things cannot possibly exist.{\i0}\N{\i1}Those are mere excuses...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.18,0:13:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.56,0:13:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}None of the previous paths to salvation{\i0}\N{\i1}had such a clear vision as this...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Awaken your spirit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, be rid of that filthy body!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.51,0:14:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,High frequency?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. I'm not exactly sure,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.15,0:14:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it has some contraption that{\i0}\N{\i1}paralyzes the sympathetic nerves.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In just seconds, everything before my\Neyes went blank and I passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If Ein didn't realize it and bite me,\NI would have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...a member of SCRATCH.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we need to devise\Na countermeasure to—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, I'll try becoming a member now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey—!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.64,0:14:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure dogs have brain waves, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed wanna wear it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you become a member,\Nwho is going to look Londes up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Welcome to SCRATCH,{\i0}\N{\i1}an electronic transcendence gr—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Good going, Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can this really be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A guy named Londes never existed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,His past, all the records,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,they were all counterfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.19,0:15:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the controls lead back to here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Alles Valley Hospice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.71,0:16:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody here would want visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And you need an appointment\Nto see someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did you come here for inheritance?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing of the sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.65,0:16:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, this girl's twin brother is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.00,0:16:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Girl? Is she really a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:17:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Actually... it's a long story...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm just having her sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course, the other bounty{\i0}\N{\i1}hunters all slept to death.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally tracked\Nthe long-lost brother to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a shock to my daughter...\NShe has been insane ever since,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.41,0:17:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and I thought about having\Nher meet her brother just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.59,0:17:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you kill off your members?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am not forcing anything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.66,0:17:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They are merely practicing a faith{\i0}\N{\i1}that they decided to believe.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why do you think people believe in God?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's because they want to.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not easy living in this rotten world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is nothing certain while{\i0}\N{\i1}living on in this world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you get it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}God didn't create humans.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Humans created God.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this little act.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.69,0:18:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,An illusion isn't enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is correct...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A man named Londes\Ndoes not exist in this world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.94,0:18:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He is merely an imaginary{\i0}\N{\i1}character I created.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A mere illusion created by scanning lines.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a brain wave controller\Nlike Brain Dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you cut off the connection between\Nthe brain wave controller and the network?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:02.75,Default - Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeah. {Extra lead-in. Made this ALT to lower CPS on that other line}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.31,0:19:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. But don't turn\Noff the life support system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you know what the greatest and worst{\i0}\N{\i1}invention that humans ever made was?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Television.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.93,0:19:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Television controls people using information{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and steals their sense of reality.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes. Now, television itself is a religion.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}TV has created people that are easily{\i0}\N{\i1}fooled by such an idiotic fantasy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.29,0:19:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.04,0:20:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one who can't tell fantasy from reality, Londes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to dream, dream alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-What do you know?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do you think you know about me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What... What are you doing?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Help! You can't do that!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.55,0:20:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop it!{\i0} {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't turn it off!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What... What did I do?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No... This is unfair...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.99,0:20:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why... am I the only one...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone should have had\Nthe same body as me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.41,0:20:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No... I...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't want to disappear!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't want to disappear...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ronny Spangen. Previously a hacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy who became\Na vegetable two years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.51,0:21:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,when he was 13, from a medical accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No... you are no longer a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.43,0:21:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a damn good con artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.23,0:21:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, long time no see. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.15,0:21:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all a kid's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.56,0:21:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all he could do was dream... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, have sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.09,0:22:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our souls that God has given us, our spirit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.10,0:22:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is not our body an existence all too{\i0}\N{\i1}small and weak for our spirits,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which found a way to swim through{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the vast network and\Nlive in the infinity of space?{\i0}
